```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Scanner as Node Integrity Scanner
    participant Node as Node 2 (Local Store)
    participant GW as Gateway / Cluster
    participant Rep as Repair Worker
    participant N1 as Node 1 (Healthy Source)
    participant N3 as Node 3 (Replacement Target)

    Note over Scanner, Node: Background Integrity Audit Cycle
    Scanner->>Node: Read object file & verify against .meta sidecar
    Note over Node: Checksum Mismatch Detected (Bit-rot / Corrupt)
    Scanner->>GW: POST /internal/corruption (node_id, object_id)
    
    GW->>GW: Mark Node 2 replica state = CORRUPT
    GW->>GW: Refresh Object Replication State -> UNDER_REPLICATED
    GW->>Rep: Schedule Repair Job (reason: CORRUPT)
    
    Note over Rep, N3: Autonomous Repair Execution
    Rep->>N1: GET /store/:objectId
    N1-->>Rep: Return raw payload + checksum
    Rep->>Rep: Verify SHA-256 against metadata canonical checksum
    Rep->>N3: PUT /store/:objectId (replicated data)
    N3-->>Rep: 200 OK
    
    Rep->>GW: Register new healthy replica on Node 3
    GW->>GW: Refresh Object Replication State -> DURABLE
    Note over GW: Durability Invariant Restored
```
